player: I've arrived to the new job, the place is kinda creepy.
boss: Hello! I'm so happy you are here, this company is like a family. Please, place all the food on the box and press the button to send it to the customers.
boss: Be careful with the food! It must be on best condition to fulfill our customer needs.
boss: If you see something weird, don't worry! Our customers have "special" needs. Don't think about it.